From: GIMP Modernization Team <team@gimp.org>
Subject: [PATCH 0001/0004] Technological Port: GTK3 to GTK4 & GSK GPU Canvas Pipeline

Migrates build definitions to GTK4 (>= 4.14.0), replaces legacy Cairo canvas
rendering with accelerated GSK GskRenderNode GPU blitting, binds GtkEventController
and multi-touch input gestures, converts top menu bar to GMenuModel / GtkPopoverMenuBar,
and upgrades container tree views to GtkListView.
---
